</item><item><title>英国股市进一步萎缩，帝国品牌吸引买家</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/imperial-brands-attracts-suitors-as-uk-stock-market-set-to-shrink-further</link><description>另外，英国央行关于人工智能危险的警告&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/imperial-brands-attracts-suitors-as-uk-stock-market-set-to-shrink-further'&gt;英国股市进一步萎缩，帝国品牌吸引买家&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Imperial Brands Attracts Suitors as UK Stock Market Set to Shrink Further&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/imperial-brands-attracts-suitors-as-uk-stock-market-set-to-shrink-further</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:31:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>关注 2027 年石油市场库存：能源方面</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/watch-stockpiling-in-oil-markets-in-2027-energy-aspects-video</link><description>Energy Aspects Ltd 表示，石油库存将是未来几年的重要因素，即使在预计全球出现盈余的情况下，也可能导致市场收紧并提振价格（来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/watch-stockpiling-in-oil-markets-in-2027-energy-aspects-video'&gt;关注 2027 年石油市场库存：能源方面&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Watch Stockpiling in Oil Markets in 2027: Energy Aspects&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/watch-stockpiling-in-oil-markets-in-2027-energy-aspects-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:45:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</link><description>日本烟草公司股价上涨，此前有消息称该卷烟制造商正在探索与奥驰亚集团公司收购帝国品牌公司的可能性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover'&gt;日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan Tobacco Climbs on Potential Imperial Brands Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:26:05 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>